# One regex per line, matched against the full URL. Only external links need
# an entry here: internal links are never ignored.

# Our own production origin: canonical, hreflang and og:image URLs point at it
# and a PR adds pages that are not deployed yet.
^https://vx\.lucasco\.dev

# Placeholders used in examples.
^https?://example\.(com|org|net)
^https?://localhost
^https?://127\.0\.0\.1

# GitHub URLs of this repo that a PR or a release has not created yet.
^https://github\.com/isaias-alt/vexillum/(releases|pull|issues|compare)
